    "detailed_description": "<h1>Trans-Siberian Express</h1><p></p><br><h1>Russian Train Trip</h1><p></p><br><h1>Russian Train Trip 2</h1><p></p><br><h1>Train Travel Simulator</h1><p></p><br><h1>Chinese Train Trip</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>You are a passenger on a train leaving from Tyumen to Novosibirsk. Your goal is to get to the end point.<br><br>The game consists of several stages with a full-fledged interesting plot.<br><br>You can look out the window and watch the changing nature, weather and architecture, listen to the radio and watch TV. You can see forests, fields, mountains, cities and villages.<br><br>The game offers you a fascinating journey across Russia by train, full of adventures, discoveries and emotions.",
    "about_the_game": "You are a passenger on a train leaving from Tyumen to Novosibirsk. Your goal is to get to the end point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game consists of several stages with a full-fledged interesting plot.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can look out the window and watch the changing nature, weather and architecture, listen to the radio and watch TV. You can see forests, fields, mountains, cities and villages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game offers you a fascinating journey across Russia by train, full of adventures, discoveries and emotions.",
    "short_description": "A first-person adventure game with a deep plot. You have to get from Tyumen to Novosibirsk on a passenger train. You can look out the window and watch the changing nature, weather and architecture. You can see forests, fields, mountains, cities and villages.",
